Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:43:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Resolve Fusion 360 presentation body names and preserve
 them in STEP shapes

- Extract BulkStream.dat presentation records (name and visual GUID) using cadmpeg-container's ArchiveSnapshot, safely decompressing zstd frames via ruzstd
- Map bodies with missing presentation names by matching their appearance visual GUID or remaining presentation order
- Restate STEP shapes (MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP, BREP_WITH_VOIDS, SHELL_BASED_SURFACE_MODEL) with their explicit body names so SolidCraft imports retain true body names (e.g. 'Bottom', 'Top') instead of generic container names
